      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُؤْلُؤَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A pearl:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَؤْلُؤٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَآلِئُ</span>:
